<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.admit.takes ~ the joinee's half of the admit

`lares nexus admit-take <bundle-file>` verifies an admit bundle offline against the charter this vessel holds, keeps it, and the dial presents it at that hearth alone.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ take

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`take` params=`file/admit.json ~ take an admit bundle`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ file

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`file` params=`takes/host-path needs/required seat/1 as/<bundle-file> ~ the admit bundle`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat-or-hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat-or-hand` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ writes this vessel's own replica`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.admit.takes file/admit.json]] ~ name the bundle file`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the bundle reads unreadable or fails verification; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ kept

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`kept` params=`exit/0 ~ the admit stands kept`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

